    The lookbook developed for the second chapter of SOTA, a Rome-\
    based store, presents a collection designed by RF_LL Studio. The\
  editorial project highlights the brand\'92s workwear roots, emphasizing\
  the intersection between utilitarian functionality and contemporary\
aesthetics. Particular attention was given to the object\'92s materiality:\
  the cover, printed on silver paper, conveys a refined yet industrial\
  sensibility, while the elastic binding evokes the idea of a work in\
 progress. Together, these choices reinforce the raw, process-oriented\
                character at the core of the collection.\
